,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Maharashtra Medical Council + MCI Code of Ethics Regulation 6.1 (advertising restrictions on doctors), ASCI medical advertising code (no guarantee of cure, no comparative claims, no before-after without qualifications), Drugs and Magic Remedies Act (prohibits ads claiming to cure certain conditions), Consumer Protection Act (misleading claims). Compliant approach: education-first content (condition explainers + procedure info), compliance-safe before-after (same lighting + angle + time + patient consent + individual-results-may-vary disclaimer), patient testimonials with written consent form, no guaranteed outcome language. In Dombivli, Maharashtra Medical Council + Maharashtra FDA + KDMC (Kalyan-Dombivli Municipal Corporation) enforcement."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What named dermatology client work should a marketing agency show?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Verifiable evidence: (1) Live URLs of dermatology clinic Instagram + Facebook + Google Business Profile with GMB rank screenshots for Dombivli pincode area, (2) 2-3 named client references (available on discovery call under NDA), (3) case study PDFs with real metrics (patient inquiries/month, cost per lead, booking conversion, revenue attribution), (4) content library samples (compliance-safe before-after + Reels + educational carousels). Red flag: 'we've worked with 50+ clinics' with no named client work + no verifiable URLs = category tourism."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What contract terms + exit clauses should dermatology clinics negotiate with a marketing agency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"6-month MSA (Master Service Agreement) with cancellation option after month 3 if agreed milestones not met — protects both sides. Monthly retainer + performance milestones defined upfront. Ad-spend transparent pass-through — client pays platforms directly OR agency bills exactly platform-invoice amount. NO ad-spend markup. IP ownership 100% client on: creative assets, content library, GMB access, WhatsApp automation, website, booking system, ALL patient data. Notice period 30-60 days. Non-solicitation clause reasonable. Avoid: 12-24 month lock-ins, IP-retention clauses, ad-spend markup, unclear termination terms, patient-data-retention by agency."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What team structure will a dermatology marketing agency assign to a Dombivli clinic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Growth-tier pod typical: (1) Account Director / Growth Lead — weekly review + monthly QBR + strategy + compliance oversight. (2) Performance marketer — Meta + Google ads + GMB + landing pages. (3) Creative pod — designer + video editor + Reels producer (8-15 pieces/month). (4) Social media manager — Instagram + Facebook + community management + DMs + WhatsApp handoff. (5) Content writer — educational carousels + captions + email + WhatsApp templates. (6) Local SEO + GMB specialist — reviews + posts + Q&A + citations. Founder + senior partner on quarterly QBR."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What reporting cadence to expect from a dermatology marketing agency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Weekly performance snapshot (Monday for previous week): patient inquiries + cost per lead + GMB rank + Reels reach + WhatsApp DMs + booking conversion. Monthly QBR (in-person for Dombivli local + video for remote): full P&L + cohort analysis + creative + channel review + next month plan + quarterly forecast. Quarterly business review: revenue against plan + tier + team + compliance audit + next quarter strategy. Compliance review monthly (any ASCI risk in content)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"In-house marketing team vs agency vs hybrid for a Dombivli dermatology clinic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In-house makes sense at Rs 60 lakh+/month clinic revenue when team is 3-4 specialists (Social + Performance + GMB + Video). Full agency for Rs 3 lakh-60 lakh/month clinic revenue — access to specialist expertise + creative + tooling + compliance advisory without hiring overhead. Hybrid (Rs 30-60 lakh/month) — in-house marketing manager + specialist agency execution for creative + performance + GMB. In Dombivli, most solo + 2-3 doctor practices operate best with full agency; multi-location chains with hybrid model. ITD positions specifically for clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams — treating marketing as an outsourced growth partner."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are red flags in dermatology marketing agency proposals?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"(1) 'Industries served 20+' category tourism with no medical/clinic depth. (2) Guaranteed leads or ROAS promises (unrealistic + ASCI-risky). (3) Bundled ad-spend + retainer (hides 15-30% markup). (4) 12-24 month lock-ins with no cancellation clause. (5) IP-retention clauses on creative + booking + patient data. (6) Junior-only team, no founder access. (7) No named clinic client work + no verifiable URLs. (8) Can't answer basic ASCI medical-advertising code questions. (9) No before-after compliance methodology. (10) Uses generic beauty-brand content templates instead of medical + educational content."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a realistic first-90-day plan from a dermatology marketing agency in Dombivli?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Month 1 — Audit + Foundation: current GMB + Instagram + website audit, baseline patient-inquiry benchmarking, ASCI compliance review of existing content, creative pipeline design (10-15 Reels + carousels), WhatsApp Cloud API setup, GMB optimisation, first landing page live. Month 2 — Launch + Iterate: paid campaigns live (Meta + Google + GMB posts), creative testing + weekly optimisation, review generation programme, first cohort measurement. Month 3 — Optimise + First QBR: channel + creative + audience optimisation, first quarterly QBR + 90-day performance review, tier recalibration, quarter-2 plan. Go/no-go milestones at day 30, 60, 90. Cancellation clause after month 3."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD GrowthLabs position itself vs other Dombivli dermatology marketing agencies?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"ITD works specifically with dermatology + haircare + hair-transplant clinics across Thane, Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, Dombivli, Kalyan, Nagpur, Nashik, and Pune. We treat clinic marketing as an outsourced growth partner — not a vendor — for clinics that don't want to build an in-house marketing team. Full-stack across social media + Reels + Meta + Google + WhatsApp + GMB + website + booking. Retainer starts at Rs 25,000-1.5 lakh + ad-spend transparent pass-through (no markup) + 6-month MSA with cancellation after month 3 + 100% client IP + founder access. Backed by our published skincare + beauty D2C content library (50-piece skincare cluster + published case studies), applied to clinical + medical context in Dombivli."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we start working with ITD GrowthLabs for a Dombivli dermatology clinic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Book a free 30-minute discovery call — Prashant Chaudhari (Business Head, ITD GrowthLabs) or a senior partner runs the call. We audit your current Google Business Profile + Instagram + Facebook + website + WhatsApp presence + benchmark against 3-5 competing Dombivli dermatology clinics + share a customised 90-day plan within 3 working days. No obligation. The proposal includes tier recommendation (Rs 25,000-1.5 lakh), expected patient-inquiry benchmarks, deliverables list, team structure, and contract terms. Whatsapp us if you'd rather send a message first — we respond within 24 hours."}}]}</script>
