      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on hiring a full-service clinic marketing agency for dermatology + skincare clinics in Dombivli, Maharashtra &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (Maharashtra Medical Council + MCI + ASCI medical advertising code), local landmarks (Dombivli East + Dombivli West + MIDC + Kopar), booking + patient-acquisition benchmarks, and how ITD GrowthLabs works with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams.</p>
